<title>NETHERLANDS: ASM Int cautious on 1997.</title>
<headline>ASM Int cautious on 1997.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>ASM International said on Friday the outlook for 1997 remained uncertain and it was cautious overall on results for the year.</p>
<p>&quot;Although there is a general consensus that the front-end equipment industry will experience improved circumstances from the second half of 1997 onwards, and the back-end sector ...somewhat earlier, ASM management remains cautious overall for the year,&quot; ASM International said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
